        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"805b7e0c-59ab-454e-994f-b738e9dc4c00\",\"review_text\":\"I'm wasn't sure if it was good or bad at ea one\"},{\"review_id\":\"67e68e68-40aa-464f-b4a2-d8f889fbf34d\",\"review_text\":\"👎👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"794e3a8a-ce9f-4b05-92d5-6915185dbc67\",\"review_text\":\"Fantastic\"},{\"review_id\":\"2044452d-3395-4859-8dbc-925c590a4db8\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app please del it and be happy\"},{\"review_id\":\"090f87dd-b07d-408a-b859-de10acb9170c\",\"review_text\":\"Car o good\"},{\"review_id\":\"db98b02f-8a79-4b0c-af77-439171a20781\",\"review_text\":\"This is such an amazing app.. Absolutely convenient and easy to use with great features.✨\"},{\"review_id\":\"819d74a8-45c5-4260-afde-72cb2cd1f876\",\"review_text\":\"I'm using this app for More than 3 years but the “New update“, you guys removed all features. I don't like it . Please make the features free . Those 3 features I needed it the most . And the lyrics tooo Please......... It's my fav music app .\"},{\"review_id\":\"c20efcd2-41c3-4020-9e26-93a45058f8f9\",\"review_text\":\"Bycot\"},{\"review_id\":\"7a5cf978-f98d-48de-8862-12291934c0e7\",\"review_text\":\"It's a great for listening music but recently it's been showing that it's offline even though it's not and it can't play songs while using other apps and it's starting to get really annoying\"},{\"review_id\":\"6b55ac9c-8dd2-4170-8782-bd35985ec0d9\",\"review_text\":\"Anyone else facing problem turning off shuffle?You need to be a premium user to turn of Shuffle playlist!This is the most idiotic thing I've ever seen!Well,Sir/Ma'am,whoever takes such innovative steps to add more Premium users, you are doing a very poor job. Letting your users listen to their playlist in proper queue is the most basic facility you can provide. Please either change it back to the way it was or I'm shifting to some other music platform. I'm sure as hell not giving in to Premium!\"}]}"
